OL,3,GNEWSAPalestinian couple and teenage
OL,4,Adaughter who died in water off Shoreham
OL,5,Anamed by police
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe family lived in London and
OL,8,Ftravelled to Shoreham, police say. The
OL,9,Fforce also says it is working with the
OL,10,Fcoroner "to understand exactly how this
OL,11,Fincident occurred"
OL,13,FPrime Minister Andy Burnham calls it "a
OL,14,Freal terrible family tragedy" and warns
OL,15,Fabout "the dangers of open water
OL,16,Fswimming"
